, "fb_downstream_use_xpost_metadata": {"downstream_use_xpost_deny_reason": "NONE"}}, "originality_info": null, "reels_on_the_rise_info": null, "reusable_text_attribute_string": null, "reusable_text_info": null, "shopping_info": null, "show_achievements": false, "may_have_template_info": null, "viewer_interaction_settings": null, "template_info": null}, "like_count": 3638, "has_liked": false, "hidden_likes_string_variant": -1, "caption": {"strong_id__": "17938465191295453", "bit_flags": 0, "created_at": 1784887857, "created_at_utc": 1784887857, "did_report_as_spam": false, "is_ranked_comment": false, "pk": "17938465191295453", "share_enabled": false, "content_type": "comment", "media_id": "3948247812822574629", "status": "Active", "type": 1, "user_id": "1527886079", "text": "⚠️ PERINGATAN\nAksi dalam video ini sangat berbahaya. Jangan ditiru!\n\nVideo seorang pria bergelantungan di luar kereta rel listrik (KRL) viral di media sosial (medsos). Petugas KAI Commuter Indonesia (KCI) mengamankan pria tersebut.\n\nPublic Relations Manager KAI Commuter, Leza Arlan, mengatakan, berdasarkan hasil pemeriksaan, pria tidak dikenal tersebut mengakui berada dalam pengaruh alkohol sehingga bergelantungan di sisi luar kereta sejak kereta berangkat dari Stasiun Jakarta International Stadium hingga tiba di Stasiun Ancol.\n\n\"Sebelum kejadian, yang bersangkutan juga diketahui memasuki area jalur rel tanpa hak meskipun telah mendapat teguran dari petugas,\" kata Leza, Jumat (24/7/2026).\n\nPria tersebut melakukan tindakan membahayakan bergelantungan di sisi luar rangkaian Commuter Line No 2247A relasi Tanjung Priok-Jakarta Kota pada Kamis (23/7) kemarin.\n\nPeristiwa tersebut diketahui saat rangkaian Commuter Line memasuki Stasiun Ancol sekitar pukul 16.48 WIB. Petugas Pengamanan stasiun yang sedang bertugas melihat seorang pria yang tidak dikenal berada di sisi luar pintu kereta kedua dari depan.\n\nPetugas kemudian segera mengamankan yang bersangkutan dan membawanya ke Pos Pengamanan di Stasiun Ancol untuk dilakukan pendataan dan pemeriksaan lebih lanjut.\n\nBaca berita selengkapnya hanya di detik.com!\n\nVideo: jakutinfo_id\nCreator: Prastiwi\n\n#detikcom #krl #jakartautara", "user": {"strong_id__": "1527886079", "pk": "1527886079", "pk_id": "1527886079", "id": "1527886079", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841400422393873", "username": "detikcom", "full_name": "detikcom", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3787832768936919438_1527886079", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-sea1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/590420429_18550963456014080_6118536616993181808_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gG54lmw3s0ZoB_byUkGiElNvshRjqQ7O13VJ4JcRfel3tU4RgVAeR813I4go5vMfjg&_nc_ohc=aQMtmpV0MjwQ7kNvwEHu_dK&_nc_gid=ABOmU1U0IdnVTd0WhUg07A&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQARkfFKRPPFoi8NiRAsTs6-sSC590xHHzdK-V7f3EXQ9w&oe=6A69445F&_nc_sid=ee9879"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "⚠️ WARNING\nThe action in this video is extremely dangerous. Don't be duped!\n\nA video of a man rolling outside an electric rail (KRL) has gone viral on social media (sos). KAI Commuter Indonesia (KCI) officers secured the man.\n\nKAI Commuter's Public Relations Manager, Leza Arlan, said, based on the investigation, the unidentified man admitted to being under the influence of alcohol and thus lying on the outer side of the train since the train departed from Jakarta International Stadium Station until it arrived at Ancol Station.\n\n\"Prior to the incident, the concerned was also known to enter the railroad area unauthorized despite receiving reprimand from officers,\" Leza said, Friday (24/7/2026).\n\nThe man committed a dangerous act on the outer side of Commuter Line No 2247A network Tanjung Priok-Jakarta Kota on Thursday (23/7) yesterday.\n\nThe incident was known when the Commuter Line network entered Ancol Station around 16.48 pm. Station Security officers on duty noticed an unidentified man outside the second train door from the front.\n\nOfficers then immediately secured the concerned and took him to a Security Post at Ancol Station for further investigation and investigation.\n\nRead full news only at detik.com !\n\n Video: jakutinfo_id \n Creator: Prastiwi \n\n #detikcom #krl #jakartautara"}, "comment_count": 151, "comment_likes_enabled": true, "play_count": 455503, "ig_play_count": 455503, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "video_duration": 7.296000003814697, "is_dash_eligible": 1, "video_dash_manifest": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<MPD xmlns=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011 DASH-MPD.xsd\" profiles=\"urn:mpeg:dash:profile:isoff-on-demand:2011\" minBufferTime=\"PT2S\" type=\"static\" mediaPresentationDuration=\"PT7.296S\" FBManifestTimestamp=\"1784902758\" FBManifestIdentifier=\"FszRm6YNGBFpZ19kYXNoX2Jhc2ljX3ZwORlWgOzQ8uTjkEKA+p6P5eOQQoCVjZLl45BCgLD7lOXjkEKAy+mX5eOQQiIYGGRhc2hfbG5faGVhYWNfdmJyM19hdWRpbyIsGRgFbGlnaHQAFgAUABIUAgA=\"><Period id=\"0\" duration=\"PT7.296S\"><AdaptationSet id=\"0\" contentType=\"video\" subsegmentAlignment=\"true\" par=\"4:5\" FBUnifiedUploadResolutionMos=\"360:75.7\"><Representation id=\"18614247214014080v\" bandwidth=\"190445\" codecs=\"vp09.00.21.08.00.01.01.01.00\" mimeType=\"video/mp4\" sar=\"1:1\" FBEncodingTag=\"dash_vp9-basic-gen2_360p\" FBContentLength=\"172988\" FBPlaybackResolutionMos=\"0:100,360:77.9,480:72.3,720:62.7,1080:52.4\" FBPlaybackResolutionMosConfidenceLevel=\"high\" FBPlaybackResolutionCsvqm=\"0:100,360:92,480:86.9,720:77.9,1080:67.3\" FBAbrPolicyTags=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"450\" frameRate=\"15360/512\" FBQualityClass=\"sd\" FBQualityLabel=\"360p\"><BaseURL>https://scontent-sea1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQP9fOTeApMqseRjSIe-VLzy0iLTS20UEd4PTP